					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Decent, but a bit short even considering the nature of the joke object. Even if it were memetic, wouldn't someone eventually get around to writing this up by deliberately avoiding direct exposure to it? You can write up a report without actually being near the subject of it, just like you can remember your examination of the subject's properties even after the memetic effects of it wear off. Failing that, I imagine they might try using Telekill to examine it&#8230;</p> 
				 	]]>
